    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steve is first and foremost a life simulator. You play through 7 days of Steve's life where you have to use resource management of energy to keep Steve sane and healthy, while also keeping up with relationships in Steve's life.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/f8e633af66a5c010d6abe082c7e423ec.poster.avif?t=1752253891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/f8e633af66a5c010d6abe082c7e423ec.webm?t=1752253891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/f8e633af66a5c010d6abe082c7e423ec.mp4?t=1752253891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spending energy</strong>:<br><br>Throughout the day as Steve you will be able to spend energy on tasks around the house, all of which cost or give energy.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/326a221d78be7a6645d90728a260159f.poster.avif?t=1752253891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/326a221d78be7a6645d90728a260159f.webm?t=1752253891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/326a221d78be7a6645d90728a260159f.mp4?t=1752253891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nighttime:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Steve goes to bed he has a decision to try to fight the boss or to try to avoid them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/d1f45868d2878a79aaf3a9a6f8b16c3b.poster.avif?t=1752253891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/d1f45868d2878a79aaf3a9a6f8b16c3b.webm?t=1752253891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/d1f45868d2878a79aaf3a9a6f8b16c3b.mp4?t=1752253891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starting Items:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every play through of Steve you get to choose a starting item that gives you a benefit and helps you accomplish your goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815430/extras/376101464c89a61e01c07fdd54ab3c08.avif?t=1752253891\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
